Hey FRIENDS!!

If you’ve been thinking about coming out for some live music, don’t stay #undecided , join us tonight for a grand time at the Belleville JAZZlicious  fest! Bill and I will be playing once more @paulosanddinkels on Bridge Street. What a gorgeous restaurant! And we both had dinner there… Fabulous! There are events happening all over the city for the evening, so you can check out the schedule online.

 https://quintewest.ca/event/belleville-jazzlicious/

#livemusic #belleville #jazzlicious #billbridges #guitar #jazz #blues #vocals #jazzsinger #supportlivemusic #finedining #jazzfest 
