Two weeks later and I still can't stop thinking about how much fun I had down at @nasarallysport @sandblastrally. I hadn't been planning on doing the McCreary Gravel Rally down in Kentucky because...well because I'm a trans girl and it's Kentucky. But on the other hand now that I've got the #rallyracing bug it's hard to pass on another #rally 🤔🤔🤔

What do y'all think? Anybody got friends down that way who could offer a safe place to stay? Or maybe any friends that way who want to help out with the entry fee? 🙃

