@virginvoyages Holiday treats. Last year’s ornament was a nutcracker. Instead of a blue ribbon that gets gross and funky for Sailing Club, we now have pins. 

This morning marks Country 43 on my quest for 50 by 50: Tortola, British Virgin Islands. I am counting Puerto Rico as a US Territory and therefore does not add to my country list despite it technically being one as of now. I may change my mind on this later in which case BVI will get bumped to 44. @msnikkis21 says it should count for both just like Scotland and Wales and Ireland are technically part of UK but still their own. It’s a valid argument. What’s your take? 

#virginvoyages #resilientlady #holidaysailing #country43 or #country44 #undecided #debate #technicality #traveladdict #cruise #caribbean #britishvirginislands #exploretheworld #portday #sailingclub #deepbluesea

Staging

Only 12 more Days until our Crystal Cottage Completion Community Celebration fundraiser for the @branthistoricalsociety 

December 8  1-4pm we open the turquoise doors for the community to see the famous Crystal Cottage in person! 

It has been a long hard road for this little house that could! 

53 Charlotte St in Brantford (beside the museum) 

Donations at the door for @branthistoricalsociety 

During your tour, try and spot if we end up using these chairs to stage the house.  How festive are they! 

#undecided 

If you’re looking one of the most unique buildings for a home,  place to open a business or both come for the tour on the 8th and have a look before it goes on the market! 

